---
accTitle: The sub-agent system, from spawn to supervision
---
flowchart TB
    P[Parent agent] -->|agent.spawn| SH[StartSpawnHandler<br/>validates · resolves grants]
    SH -->|persist first| REC[(AgentRecord<br/>+ SpawnContract)]
    SH --> RT[Agent runtime<br/>concurrency cap · queue]
    RT --> LOOP[Child agent loop<br/>same Agent class]
    LOOP --> FTR[FilteredToolRegistry<br/>grants enforced at dispatch]
    WD[Watchdog<br/>pure policy + enactment] -.->|idle breach: retry, then fail| RT
    WD --> AUDIT[(watchdog_events<br/>append-only audit)]
